;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Union Public Service Commission (UPSC)</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSC National Defence Academy &amp; Naval Academy Exam II 2026</span></b></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>UPSC NDA-II Exam 2026 : Short Details of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.6348%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin : <strong>20/05/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b> 11/06/2026 </b><b>upto 06:00 PM only<br>\n</b></span></li>\n<li>Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>11/06/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Correction Form: <strong>As per Schedule </strong></li>\n<li>Exam Held on : <strong>13/09/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <strong>Before Exam<br>\n</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.7379%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General UR / EWS&nbsp; / OBC : <b>100/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST : <b>0/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through Net Banking, Debit Card, Credit Card and Offline Fee Mode Through E Challan</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.6348%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UPSC NDA II Eligibility 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Army Wing :</b> Passed /Appearing 10+2 Exam in Any Recognized Board in India.</li>\n<li><b>For Airforce &amp; Naval Wing :</b> Passed /Appearing 10+2 Exam with Physics &amp; Math Subjects</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.7379%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UPSC NDA II Age Limit 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Candidate Not be Born Before <strong>: 01/01/2008</strong></li>\n<li>Candidates Not be Born After<strong> : 01/01/2011</strong></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per NDA II Exam Notification 2026 Recruitment Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 120.373%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UPSC NDA II Exam 2026 : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Vacancy Details Total : 394 Post</span></b></span></h2>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; height: 240px;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 52.249%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Service</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 17.5685%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Male</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.7444%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Female</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 17.4381%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 52.249%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\">NDA Army</td>\n<td style=\"width: 17.5685%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\">198</td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.7444%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\">10</td>\n<td style=\"width: 17.4381%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\">208</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 52.249%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\">NDA Navy</td>\n<td style=\"width: 17.5685%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\">37</td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.7444%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\">05</td>\n<td style=\"width: 17.4381%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\">42</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 52.249%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\">NDA Airforce Flying</td>\n<td style=\"width: 17.5685%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\">90</td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.7444%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\">02</td>\n<td style=\"width: 17.4381%; height: 24px; text-align: center;\">92</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 52.249%; height: 48px; text-align: center;\">NDA Airforce Ground Duties Tech</td>\n<td style=\"width: 17.5685%; height: 48px; text-align: center;\">16</td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.7444%; height: 48px; text-align: center;\">02</td>\n<td style=\"width: 17.4381%; height: 48px; text-align: center;\">18</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 52.249%; height: 48px; text-align: center;\">NDA Airforce Ground Duties Non Tech</td>\n<td style=\"width: 17.5685%; height: 48px; text-align: center;\">08</td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.7444%; height: 48px; text-align: center;\">02</td>\n<td style=\"width: 17.4381%; height: 48px; text-align: center;\">10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 52.249%; height: 48px; text-align: center;\">Naval Academy 10+2 Scheme</td>\n<td style=\"width: 17.5685%; height: 48px; text-align: center;\">21</td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.7444%; height: 48px; text-align: center;\">03</td>\n<td style=\"width: 17.4381%; height: 48px; text-align: center;\">24</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 120.373%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Live Photo Instruction :</strong> Candidates must upload a live photo when applying, using the website on a laptop or mobile phone. The photo must meet the criteria specified in the notification.</li>\n<li>One time registration has become necessary for all the applications of Union Public Service Commission, so all the candidates will be able to apply only after OTR.</li>\n<li>Union Public Service Commission UPSC NDA II Recruitment 2026. Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>20/05/2026 to 11/06/2026.</strong></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the NDA II Notification Before Apply the <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Recruitment </span></span>Application Form in NDA Apply Online 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Admission Entrance Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 120.373%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 120.373%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.1562%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"191\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 39.3413%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.8752%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"196\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 120.373%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 49.3541%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Apply Online</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0186%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"322\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"Apply Online UPSC NDA II Registration 2025\" href=\"https://upsconline.nic.in/upsc/OTRP/index.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 49.3541%;\" co